Fix CorrelationGauge::onNanoDisplay()'s arc() call: bool literal doesn't
convert to DGL::NanoVG::Winding

Generated against AudioPluginsCommon (spellbound-common) tag v0.8.0, the
version pinned by this repo's CMakeLists.txt AudioPluginsCommon GIT_TAG.
File: src/hui/dgl/CorrelationGauge.cpp.

WHAT IS BROKEN
--------------
DGL::NanoVG::arc()'s sixth parameter is an enum, not a bool:

    void arc(float cx, float cy, float r, float a0, float a1, Winding dir);

CorrelationGauge.cpp's decorative background-semicircle arc call passes a
bare `false` for that argument. This compiled against whatever NanoVG.hpp
snapshot the widget was originally written/reviewed against, but fails to
compile against the DPF commit this repo (and Hex) actually pins
(4238e1c7f0351bbe488d79f0899c540543ac7583):

    error: cannot convert 'bool' to 'DGL::NanoVG::Winding'

This widget is new in v0.8.0 (added in commit a28052a, "feat(common/hui):
add spectral analysis UI components") and, per Common's own CLAUDE.md,
`common/hui/dgl` "only builds when the consuming project's CMakeLists.txt
calls dpf_add_plugin() ... before FetchContent'ing this repo" -- Common's own
standalone build never fetches DPF, so this translation unit had never
actually been compiled by anything until this task (TrueSight Task 7, the
first real downstream consumer of CorrelationGauge) tried to.

THE FIX
-------
Winding is an unscoped enum nested in the NanoVG class that CorrelationGauge
inherits from (via NanoSubWidget -> NanoBaseWidget<SubWidget> -> NanoVG), so
CCW is reachable unqualified from onNanoDisplay(). CCW vs CW makes no visible
difference for a stroked (not filled) semicircle -- this is a type fix, not a
rendering-behavior change.

VERIFICATION
------------
Rebuilt `audioplugins_common_hui_dgl` (part of TrueSight's normal
`cmake --build build --parallel`) after applying this patch: compiles clean,
no warnings. Confirmed by direct edit-then-build in
build/_deps/audiopluginscommon-src before generating this patch from `git
diff` there.

Not yet reported upstream to spellbound-common.

diff --git a/src/hui/dgl/CorrelationGauge.cpp b/src/hui/dgl/CorrelationGauge.cpp
index 1431a95..bacedee 100644
--- a/src/hui/dgl/CorrelationGauge.cpp
+++ b/src/hui/dgl/CorrelationGauge.cpp
@@ -92,7 +92,7 @@ void CorrelationGauge::onNanoDisplay()
     // 4. Scale arc (semicircle from 0 to 1) ---------------------------
     // Draw a faint semicircle background for the arc
     beginPath();
-    arc(centerX, centerY, radius, 0.f, static_cast<float>(M_PI), false);
+    arc(centerX, centerY, radius, 0.f, static_cast<float>(M_PI), CCW);
     strokeColor(toDglColor(palette.border, 0.3f));
     strokeWidth(1.f);
     stroke();
